text:
{app}'s paywall showed no prices in Simulator: StoreKit returned none of its products. Add a StoreKit configuration to the Xcode project so it does, then make the review screenshots.

- Make {app2}.storekit with these products, their IDs and U.S. prices. When they already exist in App Store Connect, make a synced StoreKit configuration rather than a local one.
{list}
- Set it in the Run action's options of the scheme you build, and nowhere else: it isn't used by archives or uploads. Say in your last message which files you changed; never commit.

Then:

{route}
